   "he": "נִיתּוֹסְפוּ עֲלֵיהֶן מוֹסִיף וּמְזַכֶּה וְכוּ׳. אָמַר רַב שֵׁיזְבִי אָמַר רַב חִסְדָּא: זֹאת אוֹמֶרֶת חֲלוּקִין עָלָיו חֲבֵירָיו עַל רַבִּי יְהוּדָה.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna: If other residents «were added to» the residents of the alleyway, «he may add» food for those residents «and confer possession» to them, but he must inform the new residents of their inclusion in the merging of the alleyway. «Rav Sheizvi said» that «Rav Ḥisda said: That is to say,» i.e., we can infer from the mishna, that «Rabbi Yehuda’s colleagues disagree with him.»"
  }
